The [[Vampiric Dagger]] is an item normally obtained by combining a [[Dagger]] with a [[Blood Amulet]]. It deals more damage and attacks more rapidly than a normal [[Dagger]], also gaining {{icon/vampirism}} on hit (up to 5) and healing for each [[Vampiric]] item touching the [[Vampiric Dagger]]. It also attacks an extra time for free on stun, like all 
daggers.

When comparing the {{icon/vampirism}} gain between the [[Vampiric Dagger]] and [[Blood Amulet]], the [[Vampiric Dagger]] gains more {{icon/vampirism}} in the long term, but leaves the player with less {{icon/vampirism}} for the first 5 seconds or so, which could matter in some builds.

Overall, an excellent weapon for any [[Melee]]-[[Weapon]]-based, [[Vampirism]]-based or stun-containing build, but also generally helpful no matter what, regardless of build, since it costs no stamina.
